# APN Hub's public catalog is fully static and works without environment
# variables.
#
# The two intake forms (launch-list signup and content suggestions) use
# Netlify Forms. Netlify Forms needs no API keys or endpoints in the app: the
# forms are detected from public/__forms.html at deploy time, and submissions
# appear in the Netlify dashboard under Forms. Configure the notification email
# (and optional reCAPTCHA) in the Netlify UI, not here.
